---
/**
 * src/pages/index.astro — Digital Headquarters Homepage
 * ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 * Data + orchestration only. All rendering is handled by components.
 *
 * CONTENT STANDARDS:
 *   - Only list technologies actually in use
 *   - No fabricated metrics or statistics
 *   - Roadmap items labeled "Planned" — never presented as complete
 *   - Every claim must be explainable in an interview
 *
 * Section order:
 *   1. Hero             (Hero.astro — includes StatusPanel)
 *   2. Lab Overview     (4 honest pillar cards)
 *   3. Projects         (ProjectCard.astro × 6 — links to GitHub repo)
 *   4. Tech Stack       (TechStack.astro — verified skills only)
 *   5. Learning Journey (LearningJourney.astro)
 *   6. Contact CTA      (CTA.astro)
 */

